## 4. Tie-in to other rules **[core]**

| After council… | Use |
|----------------|-----|
| Pattern ideation / wedge ideas | `steve-jobs.mdc` Mode D + Idea Pattern Library |
| Early ideation / Jobs vision / ultrathink UI | `steve-jobs.mdc` Modes A–C |
| Architecture, scale, pitfall audit | `system-design.mdc` |
| UI, a11y, privacy, Definition of Done | `universal-product.mdc` |
| Game engine, embed, determinism | `games-building.mdc` |
| Web deploy, E2E smoke | `website-building.mdc` |
| How the agent edits the repo | `cursor-agent-discipline.mdc` |

Council **does not** replace HLD/LLD or Rams §1b — it decides *whether* and *what* to build.

